3. The AA covenants with the director that: 
(i) the AA shall apprise the director about: 
(a) Board procedures including identification of legal and other duties of Director and required 
compliances with statutory obligations; 
(b) control systems and procedures; 
(c) voting rights  at Board meetings including matters in which Director should not participate 
because of his / her interest, direct or indirect therein; 
(d) qualification requirements and provide copies of Memorandum and Articles of Association; 
(e) corporate policies and procedures; 
